msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "kdebase"
msgstr "kdebase"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "kcontrol"
msgstr "kcontrol"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "network"
msgstr "mreža"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "timeouts"
msgstr "timeouts"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set timeout values. You might want to tweak them if your "
"connection is very slow, but the default settings are appropriate for most "
"users."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here <guilabel>Timeout Values</guilabel> are the length of time an "
"application should wait for an answer from a network operation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can configure the following timeouts:"
msgstr "Možete podesiti sljedeća vremena:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Socket read:"
msgstr "Čitanje priključnice:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some applications use <firstterm>sockets</firstterm> to communicate. You can "
"think of a socket as a water tap; while it is open, water (or in our case, "
"data) comes out, without any interaction. If something stops this flow of "
"data, the application will wait for more to come. This could be a very long "
"time, but you can configure a maximum time for an application to wait with "
"this option."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "This setting will only apply to &kde; applications, of course."
msgstr "Postavke će biti primijenjene na &kde; aplikacije, naravno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Proxy connect:"
msgstr "Proksi povezivanje:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets how long to wait for a connection to a proxy server, if one is "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja koliko dugo će se čekati na konektovanje na proksi server, jednom "
"kada je podešen."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Server connect:"
msgstr "Konektovanje na server:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets how long to wait for a connection to a remote server."
msgstr "Podešava koliko dugo će se čekati na konektovanje na daljinski server."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Server response:"
msgstr "Odgovor servera:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets how long to wait for a reply from a remote server."
msgstr "Postavlja koliko dugo će se čekati na odgovor daljinskog servera:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can configure <guilabel>FTP Options</guilabel> here. At present there is "
"just two options:"
msgstr ""
"Možete podesiti <guilabel>FTP Opcije</guilabel> ovdje. Trenutno postoje samo "
"dvije opcije:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable passive mode (PASV)"
msgstr "Dozvoli pasivni režim (PASV)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Passive &FTP; is often required when you are behind a firewall. Many "
"firewalls only permit connections that were initiated from <quote>the "
"inside</quote>. Passive &FTP; is controlled by the client, which makes it "
"usable through firewalls."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mark partially uploaded files"
msgstr "Označi djelomično poslane datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a mark is placed in this box, partially uploaded files will have a "
"<literal role=\"extension\">.part</literal> extension added to the end of "
"the file. This extension is removed once the file download is complete."
msgstr ""
